  Ctrl                   Commands                          
 ----------------------------------------------------------
  Ctrl-c    F10          Quit                              
  Ctrl-h    F1           More help                         
  Ctrl-t    F2           Save snapshot                     
  Ctrl-l    F3           Load snapshot                     
  Ctrl-p    F4           Play tape                         
  Ctrl-q    F5           Reset                             
  Ctrl-o    F6           Pause/unpause tape                
  Ctrl-s    F7           Stop tape                         
  Ctrl-f                 Fast                              
  Ctrl-n                 Normal speed                      
  Ctrl-b                 Pause/Unpause emulator            
  Ctrl-m                 Toggle sound                      
  Ctrl-y                 Toggle quick loading of tapes     
  Ctrl-\    F9           Refresh screen / reset keyboard   
